    {
      "id": "claim_f2803d75226e43b28ed12be7256fa5e6",
      "statement": "Token verification is local by design: an authenticated request whose access cookie is valid performs zero Supabase network round trips, and the only verification-related network activity is the cached JWKS fetch — there is no per-request gateway or userinfo call.",
