    {
      "id": "claim_250518a8c00643c082232ee0c8f72187",
      "statement": "The Supabase sub claim is the only identity mota persists: there is no local users table, and the user_settings primary key auth_user_id receives user.sub verbatim from the settings controller — so a deleted Supabase user merely orphans a settings row, and an email change needs no synchronization because email is display-only.",
