    {
      "id": "claim_01d649569d0247268f4c37d8e3385ece",
      "statement": "Logout is best-effort by construction: OAuthController.logout clears mota's session cookies first, calls revokeSession only when both access and refresh cookies were present, and swallows every failure from that call — so a Supabase outage cannot fail logout, and anonymous logout performs no Supabase call at all.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/api/src/auth/oauth.controller.ts#L141-L165",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:56b4533d48fbf66a519ef3cb4be311e5f1c6e0cdeaabf1b59fa0ab13d15f4654:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1208e6186554481ea977dd742afb76ad",
      "statement": "The session's expires_in becomes the access cookie's Max-Age while the refresh cookie gets a fixed 30-day Max-Age (2,592,000 s), so cookie lifetimes track JWT expiry with no server-side session table; the three OAuth flow cookies (verifier, state, return URL) each get a 10-minute Max-Age.",
      "evidence": [
