    {
      "id": "claim_44766caa58e24461861f0738e074e2d6",
      "statement": "Production wires the integration through AppModule.register: main.ts injects oauthConfig { supabaseUrl, anonKey, publicUrl, fetcher: fetch } which becomes both the AUTH_CONFIG token consumed by OAuthController and the basis of the SESSION_VERIFIER token that closes over verifySupabaseSession.",
