      "id": "claim_86ea2da933e04ab1b183835c19535112",
      "statement": "When no oauthConfig is supplied, AppModule falls back to a session verifier that throws 'Supabase auth is not configured.' and OAuthController.requireConfig turns every login attempt into 503 AUTH_NOT_CONFIGURED, so tests and deployments that skip auth never see a half-working login.",
