    {
      "id": "claim_315ffc0acb704d21a47e748c1e60d4df",
      "statement": "test/fake-supabase.ts is the reference for the integration's observable behavior: it generates a real ES256 keypair and serves exactly the three endpoints the code calls — the JWKS document (public JWK with kid test-key), POST /auth/v1/token for both grants (returning an access token signed with sub 'user-<grant>', expires_in 3600, token_type bearer), and POST /auth/v1/signout which records the received refresh_token in the exported signoutRequests array. It never implements /auth/v1/authorize because that endpoint is only a redirect.",
