    {
      "id": "claim_395c9ac84f6445c89def9878cc8d4b68",
      "statement": "apps/api/test/auth.e2e.test.ts drives the full Supabase contract through the real Nest module against the fake: anonymous probes without cookies, local JWKS verification of the mota-access cookie, the authorize redirect carrying provider/prompt/code_challenge_method/redirect_to plus three 10-minute flow cookies, a 400 for cross-site return_to, the callback exchanging the code and setting session cookies, a 401 for a forged state, logout recording exactly one signout, and server-side rotation of an expired access token emitting fresh set-cookie headers.",
